{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "89dc6029240178b98dafdf106c4da8764d5ced443d96eab7b1594f14765a8f9d", "ja": "PV撮影のお仕事", "zh": "PV拍摄工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4001_p", "source_sha256": "ecd9f45423b227dd1f44d2b4f8cb98b74288da3919f82c61c747b780f2c6c4f1", "ja": "亜美。この後のPVについてだけど……\nどうだ、いいイメージ案は作れたか？", "zh": "亚美，有关于这之后的PV……\n如何，有想到不错的画面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4002_011ami", "source_sha256": "4af3f6d01a2ff7c0f5fb2b32fb6f161dadcd97999b018f3c62979196a82aed5f", "ja": "そこなんだよ兄ちゃん！", "zh": "就是那个啦，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4003_p", "source_sha256": "97afd3131cedf242c198a5b24a523eb0c60f207ba183ab9860189cb51cc86ba3", "ja": "うわ、いきなりだな。\nその様子だと、いいイメージが浮かばないとか？", "zh": "唔哇，真是突然。\n看你那样子，是没想到好画面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4004_011ami", "source_sha256": "08fd31c6760b4c579afb9fc6f42b9d267fdf0bb96317c1616ddec3521c57189c", "ja": "うん……。台本はちゃんと読んだんだよ？\nコンテとかも超見たし。なんか、超さわやかっぽいの。", "zh": "嗯……亚美有认真读过剧本了喔。\n分镜之类也看了超久，总觉得超清爽的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4005_011ami", "source_sha256": "838f015b60a3e4316abccca15c4d424a28e57083f7a801640960742b4d0eb1b6", "ja": "でね、それはそれで面白そうって思うんだけど……。\nなんかこう……、おヘソがムズムズするの。", "zh": "然后啊，亚美是觉得那样也很有趣……\n可是怎么说呢……感觉肚脐痒痒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4006_p", "source_sha256": "775f50973af3ba94c9c17840a58e94ba52ec2cc48f90e9b42da417d81481f40d", "ja": "（……ヘソが？）", "zh": "（……肚脐吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4007_011ami", "source_sha256": "13d351e306de82d2c02377841fe64e237e47413676ef040704712213d55b02c5", "ja": "亜美のPVって、ファンの兄ちゃん姉ちゃん達も、\nすっごく楽しみにしてくれてるっしょ？", "zh": "粉丝的大哥哥、大姊姊们\n也非常期待亚美的PV对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4008_011ami", "source_sha256": "34e131929468ac0fbfc1351995974ac60cbbf5bb83f91f16d21603d017b62b84", "ja": "だからー、もっとこう、もっともっと、\nメッチャ亜美っぽーくしたいんだけど～……。", "zh": "所以──希望可以表现得再更……\n再更超有亚美风格的感觉～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4009_011ami", "source_sha256": "b9c00a6df3893fdc306edf1bfab824fefd87cc7137c757657a8771ad2ae77cbf", "ja": "ねーねー、通りすがりのスーパー兄ちゃん。\nなんかいいアドバルーンない？", "zh": "问你问你，路过的超级大哥哥。\n你有没有什么好的简议？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4010_p", "source_sha256": "d5540efaecd7ae6be5bedc0f8678b6efa8aed1cc13df8b19b2de6f4e5ffe5776", "ja": "通りすがったわけじゃないけど、アドバイスか。\nうーん、そうだな……。", "zh": "我并不是路过的，但是建议啊。\n唔～这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4011", "source_sha256": "630c0e86e63e43d7df205d6c3f26a42851ddc9e6bdd88c9c28903e7bee1151e5", "ja": "信じる道を行け", "zh": "踏上你相信的道路", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4012", "source_sha256": "2dbc14dbbec1ef9920457d3009c297a8eea9ba53b52c48b68ebb3730dfbcf148", "ja": "いつも通りでいい", "zh": "和平常一样就行了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4013", "source_sha256": "1482dcb9c2b068d25d8bbceae85707bea4c67100638032e71f8d0410ac64ef23", "ja": "きれいな亜美で", "zh": "以清纯正直的亚美来表现", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4100_p", "source_sha256": "4f9978e0689a7ae6f3749cdb9fb573939c379ea3c80ec653f8eccb590109303d", "ja": "亜美がそう感じるなら、ファンも同じだと思う。\n亜美、自分を信じて、何でも言ってみてくれ。", "zh": "既然亚美是这么认为的，那粉丝们也会有同样的想法吧。\n亚美就相信自己，无论什么点子都说出来听听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4101_011ami", "source_sha256": "61e0c3b9d0c4d8ee0cf14e79e2b4e2b7ec3eafbaa51f68292889d251beec3995", "ja": "ホント？\nホントのホントに、何でも言っていいの！？", "zh": "真的？\n亚美真的真的什么都能说吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4102_p", "source_sha256": "8549dc188b195587fd3bfd11135d50456cc3b521e6994edd31f1746bd80a15b8", "ja": "ああ、本当の本当に、聞くだけ聞くよ。\nそれで、何か浮かんできそうか？", "zh": "嗯，真的真的，我会尽量听的。\n那么，想得到什么点子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4103_011ami", "source_sha256": "1616083e822fa4d32947a32ea23c801fc0bc6c90c197ab934d85be40ce51622c", "ja": "うん！　言っていいって言われたら、なんかいっぱい\n浮かんできた！　あのねあのね、最初のとこだけど～。", "zh": "嗯！因为大哥哥说可以说，所以感觉浮现了\n好多点子！然后啊然后啊，一开始的地方呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4104_p", "source_sha256": "30b1b04bf912d0181f7dfe91b1aaa330540e30d9b2f6fa4ed6955c059cb81a57", "ja": "（目を輝かせて話をし始める。\n発想のフタは、無事に取ってやれたかな）", "zh": "（她双眼炯炯有神地说了起来。\n看来顺利帮她打开灵感的盖子了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4200_p", "source_sha256": "99c48e484549346914e59ce6816e6c0363daf48a33da6a7c83242ae23b57adfd", "ja": "考えすぎないで、いつも通りでいいんじゃないか？\nそれが、ファンが応援してきた亜美の姿だし。", "zh": "别考虑太多，和平常一样就行了吧？\n毕竟那就是粉丝一路支持过来的亚美的模样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4201_011ami", "source_sha256": "da9eb19e13880f428bb0422cfac9551adbac51f57e39b67eca5a55938b867578", "ja": "そっかー、いつもどおりの亜美でいいんだ？\nさっすが兄ちゃん一筋300年、ナイスアドバルーン♪", "zh": "这样啊──只要和平常一样的亚美就可以了？\n真不愧是大哥哥300年不变，真是好简议♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4202_011ami", "source_sha256": "865ec32dd7131059289391ecd85cbabfde6c4e1a0399d753a730f62e7697a653", "ja": "そんじゃ、まずは穴掘って、ミミズを見つけて……\nんっふっふ～♪", "zh": "那就先挖个洞，然后找出蚯蚓……\n嗯哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4203_p", "source_sha256": "52a3e663344402a0de13c2ed97a9ec3f5e3e04a9147dbef1e30c180f73af0c64", "ja": "（目を輝かせて、何か企み始めている。\n悩んでいるよりはイキイキして、いい……のか？）", "zh": "（她双眼炯炯有神地打起坏主意了。\n比起让她烦恼，还是活活泼泼的比较好……吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4300_p", "source_sha256": "4a42689491b552d6b9453faed8280e7ea762cd3fe90372541594813b903c10aa", "ja": "せっかくマジメなコンセプトなんだ。\n今回は、きれいな亜美でいこうな？", "zh": "难得是个正经的企划，\n这次就以清纯正直的亚美来表现吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4301_011ami", "source_sha256": "3ca329660475b1732a62f17f97df93618c194d6ea0049fe249cd6ec45d1ef0c4", "ja": "へ？　兄ちゃん、それ、どーゆー意味？", "zh": "欸？大哥哥，那是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4302_p", "source_sha256": "27316dad47034446bfba19a5baf37f5d6f4ea1fc804d5cad09502f9288b17677", "ja": "スタッフにイタズラを仕掛けたり、ふざけたり、\nネタに走ったりの、おふざけは一切なしってことだ。", "zh": "我的意思就是完全不做像是对工作人员恶作剧、\n开玩笑或是一直搞笑，这类不正经的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4303_011ami", "source_sha256": "6493499e892249301a6ddda0d0fb3ee47478e297dd11e3cf842630848e072437", "ja": "そっか～……。兄ちゃんは、いままで亜美のこと、\nきれいじゃないって思ってたんだね……？", "zh": "这样啊……大哥哥一直以来\n都觉得亚美不清纯正直啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_4304_p", "source_sha256": "097cb029163a3623f5f44b4205dac715ba9aa59d1043468a28a9e94a7cf042f9", "ja": "ち、違うぞ！　そうじゃなくて、健全にいこうって\nいうだけで……亜美、こっちを見てくれ！", "zh": "不、不是！我不是那个意思，我只是说要你\n正常表现……亚美，拜托看我这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
